# 二进制文件 — 禁止 git 进行换行符转换或文本 diff
*.so            binary
*.a             binary
*.dylib         binary
*.dll           binary
*.apk           binary
*.ipa           binary
*.dmg           binary
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.heic          binary
*.heif          binary
*.arw           binary
*.ttf           binary
*.woff2         binary
*.icns          binary
*.ico           binary

# 跨平台脚本：统一 LF 入库，避免 Windows 检出后 bash 直接不可执行
*.sh            text eol=lf
